# No Cursor attribution

Always remove the "Made with Cursor" in the commits and PR descriptions.

When committing, pushing, or creating/updating a GitHub pull request, follow `.cursor/skills/no-cursor-attribution/SKILL.md`: never add Cursor or Co-authored-by footers; strip them from the last commit and from the PR title/body if they appear.
